  m_Name: Evento_CriseHidrica
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Crise H\xEDdrica"
  _titleEn: Water Crisis
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Secas longas esvaziam os reservat\xF3rios, e a cidade precisa racionar
    \xE1gua e buscar novas fontes."
  _summaryEn: Long droughts drain reservoirs, and the city must ration water and
    look for new sources.
  _realWorld: "Na seca de 2014 a 2015, o Sistema Cantareira, que abastece boa parte
    da Grande S\xE3o Paulo, chegou a operar com o volume morto, a reserva abaixo
    das bombas."
  _realWorldEn: "During the 2014 to 2015 drought, the Cantareira System, which supplies
    much of Greater S\xE3o Paulo, had to draw on its dead volume, the reserve below
    the intake pumps."
  _tradeOffs: "Reduzir vazamentos, diversificar fontes e reusar \xE1gua protegem
    melhor que esperar a chuva."
  _tradeOffsEn: Reducing leaks, diversifying sources and reusing water protect better
    than waiting for rain.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Sistema Cantareira (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sistema_Cantareira
